# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## v0.19.0

- Sets `related_name="perimeter_access_tokens"` on `AccessToken.created_by`, so
  it no longer clashes with other apps' `AccessToken` models on `User.accesstoken_set`
- Adds migration `0006_accesstoken_created_by_related_name` (no database changes)

**Breaking:** the reverse accessor `user.accesstoken_set` is now `user.perimeter_access_tokens`.

## v0.17.0

- Adds support for Django 5.2
- Drops support for Django versions below 4.2
- Updates ruff command in pre-commit configuration

No functional code changes.

## v0.16.0

- Add support for Django 5.0
- Add support for Python 3.12

No functional code changes.

## v0.15.0

- Drops support for Python 3.7
- Drops support for Django 2.2, 3.0 and 3.1
- Adds support for Python 3.10 and 3.11
- Adds support for Django 4.0 and 4.1
